OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOvercast with rain, some heavy,
OL,6,Fand perhaps turning thundery with
OL,7,Fgusty winds. Improving weather
OL,8,Fconditions by early afternoon with
OL,9,Frain turning to lighter showers. Cloud
OL,10,Fbreaking with some sunshine and winds
OL,11,Feasing later.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA clear night for much of the
OL,14,Fregion, and with light winds
OL,15,Ftemperatures will fall quickly, with a
OL,16,Fchance of frost in rural areas. Some
OL,17,Fcloud arriving later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
