OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FFine and bright on Thursday
OL,6,Fafter a chilly start. The best of the
OL,7,Fhazy sunshine in eastern areas, with
OL,8,Fsome cloudier spells further west.
OL,9,FFeeling warmer by afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudier
OL,12,Fwith some rain later on Friday. Drier
OL,13,Fand brighter over the weekend with
OL,14,Fsome sunny or clear spells.
OL,15,FTemperatures near or rather above
OL,16,Fnormal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
